{"timestamp": 1779367880.89407, "event_type": "body_reported", "tick": 11, "data": {"caller": "player_1", "reason": "Bob reported a dead body", "bodies": [{"room": "electrical", "victim_name": "Diana"}]}}
{"timestamp": 1779367880.895519, "event_type": "phase_changed", "tick": 11, "data": {"phase": "discussion"}}
{"timestamp": 1779367886.9878678, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "I found Diana's body in electrical. My route was storage \u2192 medbay \u2192 electrical. I saw Eve in medbay from tick 8 through 10, and importantly, I witnessed Eve come INTO medbay FROM electrical at tick 7. That puts Eve leaving the room where Diana died right before I arrived. Very suspicious. I'd like to hear Eve explain what she was doing in electrical and why she left."}}
{"timestamp": 1779368028.217354, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I started in navigation working on my task. Frank was there with me at tick 4 \u2014 he came in from security. Then I moved to security to do my CheckCamera task, and Alice was already there when I arrived at tick 6, still there at tick 7. I've been in security since then.\n\nSo I can vouch that Alice was in security around ticks 6-7, nowhere near electrical. Bob's account of Eve leaving electrical right before he found Diana sounds damning \u2014 I'd like to hear Eve's side before we vote, but right now Eve is the prime suspect."}}
{"timestamp": 1779368061.47573, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "Bob, you're twisting the timeline to make me look bad! Yes, I passed through electrical and saw Diana there, but she was perfectly alive when I left to go do my Submit Scan task in medbay at tick 7. \n\nYou and I were literally standing in medbay together from tick 8 until tick 10. During those ticks while we were together, anyone could have easily slipped into electrical from the cafeteria and killed her! Then at tick 10, you walk into electrical and instantly report. Honestly, how do we know you didn't just kill her the second you walked in and self-reported to frame me? I'm telling you, I didn't touch Diana, she was fine when I left."}}
{"timestamp": 1779368074.555307, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "I'll share what I know. My route was weapons \u2192 security \u2192 navigation \u2192 storage. I was in navigation at tick 4 with Charlie \u2014 I can confirm Charlie was there, and I saw Charlie leave navigation toward security at tick 4. That matches Charlie's account perfectly.\n\nI didn't go anywhere near electrical or medbay this round, so I can't directly verify what happened between Bob, Eve, and Diana. But let me think about this:\n\nEve admits she was in electrical with Diana right before Bob arrived. That's opportunity. Her counter-argument is that Bob could have self-reported \u2014 but Bob arriving at electrical at tick 10 after being in medbay with Eve from tick 8-10 means Bob's window to kill is extremely tight, basically the moment he walked in.\n\nMeanwhile, Eve had Diana alone in electrical at tick 7. That's the cleaner kill opportunity.\n\nCharlie vouches for Alice in security ticks 6-7. I vouch for Charlie at tick 4. Bob and Eve vouch for each other ticks 8-10 in medbay \u2014 but only one of them killed Diana, and Eve was in electrical first.\n\nI'm leaning Eve. Alice, you're last \u2014 what do you have?"}}
{"timestamp": 1779368153.157849, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "I'll add what I have. My route was electrical \u2192 security \u2192 weapons. Importantly, I was in electrical earlier in the round before moving to security at tick 6. Diana was not dead when I left electrical \u2014 I'd have reported it.\n\nCharlie's account checks out from my side: I was in security when Charlie arrived at tick 6 from navigation, and we were both there through tick 7. Then I moved on to weapons.\n\nSo here's where I land: Charlie and Frank vouch for each other early. Charlie vouches for me in security ticks 6-7. Frank's route (weapons \u2192 security \u2192 navigation \u2192 storage) keeps him away from the crime scene. That leaves Bob and Eve as the only two with electrical access in the kill window.\n\nEve was alone with Diana in electrical at tick 7 \u2014 that's the prime opportunity. Bob's \"self-report frame\" theory is possible but weaker: he'd have had to kill instantly on entry, and Eve had the cleaner solo window with Diana.\n\nI'm voting Eve."}}
{"timestamp": 1779368265.29136, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "Wait, I already spoke first \u2014 looks like the speeches are now complete and we're voting. To reiterate my position: I found Diana's body in electrical at tick 10. I witnessed Eve coming OUT of electrical INTO medbay at tick 7, then she was with me in medbay 8-10. Alice and Frank's analysis confirms Eve had the clean solo window with Diana. I'm voting Eve."}}
{"timestamp": 1779368304.532035, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "Eve"}}
{"timestamp": 1779368318.629636, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "Bob"}}
{"timestamp": 1779368428.793891, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": ""}}
{"timestamp": 1779368438.9940171, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "I've already laid out my analysis above, so I'll keep this brief: Charlie and Frank alibi each other early, Charlie alibis me in security 6-7, and Frank's route stays clear of electrical entirely. Eve had Diana solo in electrical at tick 7, which is the cleanest kill window. Bob's self-report frame would require an instant kill on entry \u2014 possible but much less likely than Eve's clean opportunity. My vote is Eve."}}
